      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2001 John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "Psychopharmacological studies were conducted on an extract of Andrographis paniculata herbs. The extract exhibited a significant alteration in behaviour pattern and a reduction in spontaneous motility. The extract also produced a prolongation of the pentobarbitone-induced sleeping time and lowered the body temperature in different experimental animal models."
